      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "The High-Performance Alternative to Traditional Textiles",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 18,
        "text": "<p>Straw introduces a textile-like surface texture that delivers a <strong>softer, more natural look and feel </strong>— without compromising resistance or cleanability. </p><p>It was developed precisely to meet the need for upholstery that combines the appeal of textile with superior performance,<strong> resisting abrasion, fire, and fluids, and providing reliability</strong> far beyond traditional textiles in demanding shared spaces.<br/><br/></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "center",
