        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>The product’s extended lifespan — supported by a 10-year warranty — reduces waste and the environmental footprint associated with frequent replacement. </p><p>Carefully produced through a predominantly <strong>handmade process</strong>, each article naturally presents greater colour variation between batches, an inherent characteristic that enhances the individuality and uniqueness of every piece.<br/><br/></p>",
